{"unit_id":"DevourerM__tree-chat#card-zh","repo":"DevourerM/tree-chat","commit":"1c287fa2705ffa13bbfe99c1050c5bc415759d08","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"tree-chat 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的对话树与上下文管理插件，在原生侧栏展示会话节点及分支关系。它允许从历史节点继续开枝、切换分支、重排和编辑节点，并支持撤销重做、集合折叠、压缩记录、导入导出及项目同步。插件通过 DSH 原生会话服务组装不同路径的上下文，适合需要并行探索话题、整理长对话或迁移会话的用户。无需额外 API 密钥；树数据默认存于 DSH 本机目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host/index.js:11-20","lib/host/service.js:35-52","lib/core/branches.js:1-19"]}
{"unit_id":"DevourerM__tree-chat#card-en","repo":"DevourerM/tree-chat","commit":"1c287fa2705ffa13bbfe99c1050c5bc415759d08","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"tree-chat is a DSH web plugin that shows conversation branches in a native sidebar. Users can branch from earlier turns, edit and rearrange nodes, group them, track compaction, and import or export conversations. It builds branch context with native DSH sessions and needs no extra API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/host/index.js:11-20","lib/host/service.js:35-52","lib/core/branches.js:1-19"]}
